 reading:{title:'Mia Gets Ready',text:'Mia looks outside. She sees the sun. She puts on a blue shirt. She puts on brown shoes. She takes her yellow hat. The hat shades her head.\n\nLater, Mia sees rain. She goes inside. Her hat is not a rain hat. Mia waits with her friend. They look at the rain.',qa:[['What does Mia see first?','The sun.','She sees the sun.'],['What color is her shirt?','Blue.','She puts on a blue shirt.'],['What shades her head?','Her yellow hat.','The hat shades her head.'],['Where does Mia go when it rains?','Inside.','She goes inside.']]},
 listening:{title:'A Walk with Leo',script:'Hello! My name is Leo. I look outside. I see the sun. It is a nice day. I want to go for a walk. First, I put on my shirt. My shirt is green. I like my green shirt. Next, I put on my shoes. My shoes are brown. I put one shoe on each foot. Now I look for my hat. Where is my hat? Here it is! My hat is yellow. I put it on my head. The hat gives my head some shade.\n\nI walk with my mom. We see a small bird. We stop and look at the bird. Then we look up. We see clouds. Now we see rain. We go inside. My yellow hat is a sun hat. It does not keep the rain away. We sit together and wait. I take off my shoes. I put my hat on a chair. After a little time, the rain stops. I look outside again. I can see the sun! I smile at my mom. We can take our walk now.',qa:[['What color is Leo’s shirt?','Green','My shirt is green.',['Green','Blue','Red']],['Where does Leo put his hat?','On his head','I put it on my head.',['On his head','On his feet','On a chair at the start']],['What do Leo and his mom do when it rains?','Go inside','We go inside.',['Go inside','Sit in the rain','Run to school']]]},
