 frames:['What is it? It is a ___.','I have a ___. Do you want it?','I want the ___, please.'],
 reading:{title:'The Toy Swap',text:'Ella and Ben have a toy box. Ella has a doll and a teddy. Ben has a ball, a car and a train.\n\n“I want the train, please,” says Ella. Ben gives her the train. “Thank you!” she says. Ben points to the teddy. “What is it?” he asks. “It is a teddy. Do you want it?” asks Ella. “Yes, please,” says Ben.\n\nThey play for ten minutes. Then they put every toy back in the box. They do not keep each other’s toys.',qa:[['Who has the train at the start?','Ben.','Ben has a ball, a car and a train.'],['Which toy does Ella request?','The train.','I want the train, please'],['What does Ben want?','The teddy.','Ben points to the teddy.'],['Do they keep each other’s toys?','No.','They do not keep each other’s toys.']]},
 listening:{title:'Sam’s Play Table',script:'Welcome to our play table. I am Sam. There are five toys here today. I have a red ball and a small blue car. My friend Nina has a doll and a teddy. There is a green train in the middle of the table. The train belongs to our class.\n\nNina looks at my ball. She says, I want the ball, please. I give her the ball. She says thank you. Then I look at her teddy. What is it? I ask. It is a teddy, she says. Do you want it? Yes, please. I want the teddy. Nina gives it to me. It is soft and brown.\n\nWe play together. Nina rolls the ball slowly. I make the teddy wave. Another friend, Alex, comes to the table. He wants the train. He says, Can I have the train, please? We say yes. Alex moves the train around the table.\n\nAt the end, we stop playing. Nina gives my ball back. I give her teddy back. Alex puts the train in the class box. We thank each other. Everyone has a turn, and all five toys are safe.',qa:[['What color is Sam’s car?','Blue','a small blue car',['Blue','Red','Green']],['Which toy does Sam ask for?','The teddy','I want the teddy.',['The teddy','The doll','The train']],['Where does Alex put the train at the end?','In the class box','Alex puts the train in the class box.',['In the class box','In his bag','Under a chair']]]},
