 applyB:[['Ask politely for a train.','Can I have the train, please?'],['Tell a friend that you have a doll.','I have a doll.'],['Answer: What is it? Use ball.','It is a ball.'],['Offer your car to a friend.','Do you want the car?'],['Ask for your teddy back politely.','Can I have my teddy back, please?']],
